  "description": "Ameer Al Oudh Intense Oud is a rich and powerful fragrance that blends smoky oud with sweet vanilla and warm amber. The scent is bold, cozy, and highly addictive, delivering a deep Middle Eastern character with a modern gourmand twist. The opening introduces smoky woody notes combined with a hint of sweetness, creating a warm and slightly burnt sugar effect. The heart develops into rich oud and creamy vanilla, adding depth, smoothness, and a comforting gourmand character. The base settles into amber, sugar, and woody accords, leaving a long-lasting, warm, and smoky-sweet trail. Ameer Al Oudh Intense Oud is perfect for those who enjoy strong oud fragrances with a sweet vanilla and amber warmth.",
